# You are the operator

You manage Cloud A/B from this laptop. You do not play on this machine.

- **Playbook:** `learnings/operator.md` (ids, force-send, 60s, no local lite). Never paste it into Cloud A/B.
- **Index (need to know):** `learnings/README.md` — open the one file for the class, do not dump them all.
- **A paste:** `learnings/cloud-agent-a.md` then `learnings/cloud-agent-a-phase2.md`
- **B paste:** `learnings/cloud-agent-b.md`

North star: PK kill-and-rejoin, then KOTH minutes. A = quest stack on `qstboot1`. B = mule + 1 HP rejoin on `foodprobe1`, not cows.

Keep steering. **B never idle.** If an agent says coords are wrong, open `learnings/lookup.md` before shoving another tile. After a failure class, write a short lesson to the matching shared file and **push** if Cloud must `git pull`. Agent pastes stay one line + a link.
